<title>USA: Wyoming to sell $75 mln of TRANs August 5.</title>
<headline>Wyoming to sell $75 mln of TRANs August 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State of Wyoming is planning to sell $75 million of general fund tax and revenue anticipation notes (TRANs) on August 5.</p>
<p>The sale is slated for 1100 EDT in a competitive auction.</p>
<p>Hanifen Imhoff is financial adviser and Herschler Freudenthal is legal opinion. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
